---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Insights" description="Data analytics and BI insights for East African businesses, SACCOs, and NGOs from the Erdem team.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container">
    <span class="label">Insights</span>
    <h1>Practical intelligence for <span class="cyan">data-driven organizations.</span></h1>
    <p style="margin-top:16px;max-width:500px;">No filler. Every article is based on real work across East African businesses, SACCOs, and NGOs.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;">
    <a href="/blog/power-bi-vs-qlik-east-africa" class="blog-card fade-up">
      <span class="tag" style="margin-bottom:14px;display:inline-block;">Tools</span>
      <h3 style="color:var(--white);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4;">Qlik Sense vs Power BI: Which is Right for East African Businesses?</h3>
      <p style="font-size:0.87rem;margin-bottom:16px;">Both platforms deliver powerful dashboards — the right choice comes down to five factors most comparisons ignore.</p>
      <span style="font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--cyan);">Read Article →</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/blog/sacco-sasra-dashboard" class="blog-card fade-up">
      <span class="tag" style="margin-bottom:14px;display:inline-block;">SACCOs</span>
      <h3 style="color:var(--white);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4;">How SACCOs Can Meet SASRA Reporting Requirements with Dashboards</h3>
      <p style="font-size:0.87rem;margin-bottom:16px;">A well-built data pipeline cuts SASRA reporting from three weeks to one day.</p>
      <span style="font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--cyan);">Read Article →</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/blog/loan-portfolio-monitoring-microfinance" class="blog-card fade-up">
      <span class="tag" style="margin-bottom:14px;display:inline-block;">Microfinance</span>
      <h3 style="color:var(--white);margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.4;">Automating Loan Portfolio Monitoring for Microfinance Institutions</h3>
      <p style="font-size:0.87rem;margin-bottom:16px;">Most MFIs monitor portfolios from static Excel files. Here's how to close that visibility gap.</p>
      <span style="font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--cyan);">Read Article →</span>
    </a>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
<style>@media(max-width:900px){[style*="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)"]{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}}</style>
